Package: SCProkaR
Type: Package
Title: Microbial Single-Cell RNA-Seq Analysis for Bacterial Systems
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R:
    c(
      person("Ning", "Liu", email = "ning.liu@adelaide.edu.au",
             role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Jinxin", "Zhao", role = "aut")
    )
Description: SCProkaR provides a SingleCellExperiment-centred workflow for
    microbial single-cell RNA sequencing data. It standardises bacterial
    input objects from count matrices, 10x Genomics directories or Seurat
    objects, and computes prokaryote-specific quality-control metrics such
    as ribosomal RNA fraction. It performs batch integration with several
    backends and scores the resulting embeddings with scIB-inspired
    benchmarking metrics. It also supports pseudobulk differential
    expression with edgeR and Time Aware Trajectory Analysis (TATA), a
    time-informed trajectory abstraction for perturbation time courses.
